# The fuzzing corpora and reproducers (fuzz/loader/corpus, fuzz/loader/findings)
# are WebAssembly test inputs for the fuzz harnesses (fuzz/README.md), made by
# the project's own tooling; nothing is built from them and nothing of them is
# installed.
plzig source: source-contains-prebuilt-wasm-binary [fuzz/*]

# The file named is the notice file of the Zig toolchain package's sources
# (packaging/zig-toolchain/), not of this package; the notices for what this
# package contains (WAMR: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, which ships no NOTICE
# file) are in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES and debian/copyright.
plzig source: missing-notice-file-for-apache-license [packaging/zig-toolchain/NOTICE]
